Sales Cloud ke core objects ek dusre se kaise connected hote hain aur data kaise flow karta hai

Chalo **Salesforce Sales Cloud** ko **detail + Hinglish** mein samajhte hain — **objects, fields, relations, aur end-to-end data flow** ke saath.
Main pehle **objects explain** karunga, phir **data flow**, aur last mein **simple flowchart (ASCII)** dunga jo interview + real project dono ke kaam aaye.

---

## 1️⃣ Campaign (Marketing Side ka Boss)

**Use:** Marketing activities track karna (Email, Ads, Events)

**Important Fields:**

* Campaign Name
* Type (Email, Webinar, Event)
* Status (Planned, In Progress, Completed)
* Start Date / End Date
* Budgeted Cost
* Actual Cost

**Relations:**

* Campaign → **Leads**
* Campaign → **Contacts**
* Campaign Members (junction object)

👉 Matlab ek campaign se multiple leads & contacts linked hote hain.

---

## 2️⃣ Campaign Member (Bridge Object)

**Use:** Bataata hai kaunsa **Lead/Contact** kis **Campaign** ka part hai

**Key Fields:**

* Campaign
* Lead OR Contact
* Status (Sent, Responded, Attended)

---

## 3️⃣ Lead (Potential Customer – Unqualified)

**Use:** Jab customer ka sirf interest pata ho

**Important Fields:**

* Lead Name
* Company
* Email
* Phone
* Lead Source (Campaign, Website)
* Status (Open, Working, Qualified)

**Relations:**

* Lead → Campaign (via Campaign Member)

👉 Jab lead **Qualified** hota hai → **Convert** hota hai

---

## 4️⃣ Lead Conversion (Auto Process)

Lead convert hone par Salesforce automatically banata hai:

✔ **Account**
✔ **Contact**
✔ **Opportunity** (optional)

---

## 5️⃣ Account (Company / Organization)

**Use:** Customer ki company ka record

**Important Fields:**

* Account Name
* Account Type (Customer, Partner)
* Industry
* Billing Address
* Phone

**Relations:**

* Account → Contacts (1-to-Many)
* Account → Opportunities
* Account → Orders
* Account → Cases

---

## 6️⃣ Contact (Person in Account)

**Use:** Company ke individual log

**Important Fields:**

* First Name
* Last Name
* Email
* Phone
* Account (Lookup)

---

## 7️⃣ Opportunity (Deal / Sales Pipeline)

**Use:** Actual revenue tracking

**Important Fields:**

* Opportunity Name
* Account
* Amount
* Stage (Prospecting, Negotiation, Closed Won)
* Close Date

**Relations:**

* Opportunity → Account
* Opportunity → Products (via Opportunity Line Items)

---

## 8️⃣ Product (What you sell)

**Use:** Actual item / service

**Important Fields:**

* Product Name
* Product Code
* Active

---

## 9️⃣ Price Book (Product Pricing Container)

**Use:** Different pricing strategies

**Types:**

* Standard Price Book
* Custom Price Book

---

## 🔟 Price Book Entry (Actual Price)

**Use:** Product + Price Book ka combination

**Important Fields:**

* Product
* Price Book
* Unit Price
* Active

👉 **Product bina Price Book Entry ke sell nahi ho sakta**

---

## 1️⃣1️⃣ Opportunity Line Item (Products in Deal)

**Use:** Opportunity ke andar kaunsa product kitni quantity mein sell ho raha hai

**Fields:**

* Opportunity
* Product
* Quantity
* Sales Price

---

## 1️⃣2️⃣ Order (Confirmed Purchase)

**Use:** Jab deal Closed Won ho jaaye

**Important Fields:**

* Order Number
* Account
* Order Status
* Effective Date

**Relation:**

* Order → Account
* Order → Order Products

---

## 1️⃣3️⃣ Case (Customer Support)

**Use:** After-sales issues / support

**Important Fields:**

* Case Number
* Account
* Contact
* Status (New, Working, Closed)
* Priority

---

# 🔁 END-TO-END DATA FLOW (Step by Step)

```
Campaign
   ↓
Campaign Member
   ↓
Lead
   ↓ (Lead Conversion)
Account + Contact + Opportunity
   ↓
Opportunity
   ↓
Add Products
   ↓
Price Book Entry
   ↓
Opportunity Line Items
   ↓
Closed Won
   ↓
Order
   ↓
Post Sales Support
   ↓
Case
```

---

# 🧠 Real-Life Example (Easy Samajhne ke liye)

1️⃣ Company ne **Email Campaign** chalaya
2️⃣ Customer ne response diya → **Lead** bana
3️⃣ Sales ne lead qualify kiya → Convert
4️⃣ **Account + Contact + Opportunity** create
5️⃣ Opportunity mein **Product add** hua
6️⃣ Deal **Closed Won**
7️⃣ **Order** create hua
8️⃣ Product issue aaya → **Case logged**

---

